Package: spreadgen
Title: Generic Pest Spread Models (Robinet et al. 2012) for Pest Risk Screening
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel", "Flo", email = "daniel.flo@vkm.no", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A terra-based port of the generic spread module of Robinet et al. (2012, PLoS ONE 7: e43366;
    doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0043366): simple logistic growth, radial range expansion and a 2Dt dispersal-kernel
    integrodifference model, run on a suitability raster with Monte Carlo over PERT-distributed parameters.
    Outputs are scenarios conditional on assumptions, not predictions. The original code is CC0-1.0
    (DANS doi:10.17026/DANS-2XV-Z3DX).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    terra,
    data.table,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    raster,
    sf,
    ggplot2,
    viridis,
    tidyterra,
    future.apply
Config/testthat/edition: 3
